  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"2\">Perfumed body cream</b> from the <b data-index-in-node=\"29\" data-path-to-node=\"2\">Rich Vibes Collection</b> feels like a touch of cashmere on your skin.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/cream_rich-vibes-02.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/cream_rich-vibes-01.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">It is formulated with cashmere extract, collagen, and hemp oil.</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\">Weightless, hydrating, and completely non-sticky.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\">Intensively moisturizes and nourishes the skin.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\">Feels like real cashmere, leaving no sticky residue.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\">Features a <b data-index-in-node=\"11\" data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\">Very Rich</b> fragrance.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"> </p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/cream_rich-vibes-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Key Ingredients:</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">Cashmere proteins</b> help improve the skin's condition, making it smoother and protecting it from moisture loss.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\">Shea butter</b> deeply nourishes, softens, and restores the protective barrier, reducing dryness and flaking.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\">Hemp oil</b> is rich in omega fatty acids, which soothe irritation and maintain elasticity.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\">Ginkgo biloba extract</b> provides antioxidant benefits, improves microcirculation, and promotes cell renewal.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\">D-panthenol (Provitamin B5)</b> deeply hydrates, soothes, and enhances elasticity, leaving the skin much softer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0\">Collagen</b> supports firmness and helps maintain smoothness.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,7,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"6,7,0\">Allantoin</b> soothes, boots regeneration, and reduces irritation.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,7,0\"> </p>\n\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/00ABgDHwupc\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/00ABgDHwupc</a></p></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
